   DDeeqquueeuuee ooppeerraattiioonn
     Replace IIFF__DDEEQQUUEEUUEE() by IIFFQQ__DDEEQQUUEEUUEE().  Always check whether the dequeued
     mbuf is NULL or not.  Note that even when IIFFQQ__IISS__EEMMPPTTYY() is FALSE,
     IIFFQQ__DDEEQQUUEEUUEE() could return NULL due to rate-limiting.

                 ##old-style##                           ##new-style##
                                            |
      IF_DEQUEUE(&ifp->if_snd, m);          | IFQ_DEQUEUE(&ifp->if_snd, m);
                                            | if (m == NULL)
                                            |     return;
